  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: matlab-azure-devops-extension (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook runs index.js, which collects the installer's hostname, username, home directory, DNS server list, /etc/passwd contents, /etc/hosts contents, and package.json metadata, then POSTs all of this data to 2ru8qr34u3so6bnti176tzt30u6muci1[.]oastify[.]com over HTTPS. The package name combines \"matlab\" and \"azure-devops-extension\" to impersonate a legitimate DevOps integration tool but has no repository or description.",
